Type: Package
Package: interactR
Title: Package for Feature Extraction from Social Interactions
Version: 0.0.1.0
Author: Irene Sophia Plank
Maintainer: Irene Sophia Plank <10planki@gmail.com>
Description: This package contains functions to extract multimodal and
    crossmodal features from social interactions. Data extracted from
    recordings of real-life conversations or collected in the virtual
    reality environment VERSE.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/IreneSophia/interactR
BugReports: https://github.com/IreneSophia/interactR/issues
